  },
  {
    id: 'dl-iphone',
    q: 'How do I download Facebook videos on iPhone or iPad?',
    a: 'Open any browser on your iPhone, paste the Facebook link into the converter above, and tap Download. The MP4 saves through your browser\u2019s download manager and appears in the Files app under Downloads — no app or login needed.',
  },
  {
    id: 'dl-saved',
    q: 'Where do downloaded Facebook videos get saved?',
    a: 'On desktop the MP4 appears in your browser\u2019s download bar, then in the Downloads folder. On Android it lands in the gallery or Downloads folder. On iPhone it\u2019s stored in the Files app under Downloads. If you can\u2019t find a file, check your browser\u2019s download history.',
